      "content": "but why would I want to rebuild? that's just more work, more effort for something that's still ultimately going to be nothing. it feels like you're just trying to find a way to make the emptiness sound poetic or productive, but it doesn't change the fact that it's just... empty. if the nothingness is the only actual truth, then isn't fighting it just a form of delusion? isn't it more honest to just stop fighting?",
